---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="Privacy details for Study Timer Online, a no-account browser timer site." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <section class="page-band">
    <div class="container-page legal-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy.</h1>
      <p>Study Timer Online is built for instant use. The v1 site does not require an account, does not run a backend timer service, and does not need personal information to operate.</p>
      <h2>Local preferences</h2>
      <p>Timer preferences such as theme, Pomodoro settings, study task text, and flip clock options may be stored in your browser using localStorage. They stay on your device unless you clear them.</p>
      <h2>Share links</h2>
      <p>Countdown, Pomodoro, and event countdown links may include setup details in the URL query string, such as duration, task text, event name, or date. Only share links that contain information you are comfortable sharing.</p>
      <h2>Notifications and audio</h2>
      <p>Browser notifications and sounds only run after you interact with the page and grant permission where required by your browser.</p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>The launch plan assumes no analytics by default. If privacy-friendly analytics are added later, this page should be updated before deployment.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>